- Settings.
- Local save.
- Web Audio synthesis.
- Desktop keyboard input and mobile joystick.

The new implementation must preserve useful behavior while changing the rendering and maze structure.

## 16.2 Migration Mapping

| Old implementation | New implementation |
|---|---|
| Canvas 2D renderer | Three.js WebGLRenderer |
| `layout(seed)` | New 64×64 MazeGenerator |
| `bfs()` | Pathfinding.js |
| `draw()` | MazeRenderer.js |
| 2D Player coordinates | 3D world coordinates |
| Monster | Guard NPC |
| Five keys | Five access keys |
| Four quiz doors | Four historical quiz doors |
| Monster quick quiz | Guard encounter quiz |
| Spike traps | Historical environmental obstacles |
| Keyboard movement | First-person controller |
